helm installation & configration 
Since you're using Ubuntu VM and learning Kubernetes, Helm, ArgoCD, Prometheus, and Grafana, Helm is the package manager for Kubernetes. It helps you install applications like Nginx, Prometheus, Grafana, Jenkins, and ArgoCD with a single command.

1. Verify Kubernetes Cluster
Make sure Minikube is running:



minikube status
Check nodes:



kubectl get nodes
Expected:



NAME       STATUS   ROLES           AGE
minikube   Ready    control-plane
2. Install Helm
Download and Install


curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/main/scripts/get-helm-3 | bash
Verify installation:



helm version
Example output:



version.BuildInfo{Version:"v3.x.x"}
3. Check Helm Environment


helm env
List configured repositories:



helm repo list
Initially:



Error: no repositories to show
4. Add Helm Repository
Add Bitnami repository:



helm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami
Verify:



helm repo list
Output:



NAME      URL
bitnami   https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami
Update repositories:



helm repo update
5. Search Available Charts
Search all charts:



helm search repo
Search Nginx:



helm search repo nginx
Search Jenkins:



helm search repo jenkins
Search PostgreSQL:



helm search repo postgresql
6. Install Nginx Using Helm


helm install my-nginx bitnami/nginx
Verify:



helm list
Check Pods:



kubectl get pods
Check Service:



kubectl get svc
7. Get Helm Release Details


helm status my-nginx
Get values:



helm get values my-nginx
8. Customize Values
Download default configuration:



helm show values bitnami/nginx > values.yaml
Edit:



vi values.yaml
Example:



replicaCount: 3
Install using custom values:



helm install my-nginx bitnami/nginx -f values.yaml
9. Upgrade Helm Release
Suppose you change replicas:



replicaCount: 5
 
Upgrade:



helm upgrade my-nginx bitnami/nginx -f values.yaml
Verify:



kubectl get pods
You should see 5 pods.

10. Helm Rollback
View revisions:



helm history my-nginx
Rollback:



helm rollback my-nginx 1
11. Uninstall Application


helm uninstall my-nginx
Verify:



helm list
12. Install Prometheus & Grafana
Add repository:



helm repo add prometheus-community https://prometheus-community.github.io/helm-charts
 
helm repo update
Install:



helm install monitoring prometheus-community/kube-prometheus-stack
Check:



kubectl get pods
This installs:

Prometheus
Grafana
AlertManager
Node Exporter
Kubernetes monitoring components
13. Install ArgoCD Using Helm
Create namespace:



kubectl create namespace argocd
Add repo:



helm repo add argo https://argoproj.github.io/argo-helm
 
helm repo update
Install:



helm install argocd argo/argo-cd -n argocd
Check:



kubectl get pods -n argocd
Most Important Helm Commands
Command	Purpose
helm version	Check Helm version
helm repo list	List repositories
helm repo add	Add repository
helm repo update	Update repositories
helm search repo nginx	Search charts
helm install	Install application
helm list	List releases
helm status	Release status
helm upgrade	Upgrade application
helm history	View revisions
helm rollback	Rollback release
helm uninstall	Remove application
